@startuml
title WPF — application lifetime
actor Operator
participant "WPF App (UI thread)" as App
participant "Initialization scope (worker)" as Worker
participant IAppDataInitializer as Setup
participant "Host and DI container" as Host

Operator -> App : Launch application
App -> App : Open WPF rolling file logger
App -> App : Show splash
App -> Host : Build host
App -> Worker : Start database initialization
Worker -> Setup : MigrateAsync()
Worker -> Setup : SeedAsync()
Worker -> Worker : Dispose initialization scope
Worker --> App : Initialization complete
App -> Host : Resolve MainWindow
App -> App : Set and show MainWindow, close splash
... Application idle ...
Operator -> App : Close main window
App -> App : OnExit
App -> Host : Dispose
App -> App : Dispose file logger
@enduml
